      "slug": "fptr-cushion",
      "term": "Front post treble",
      "definition": "A treble worked by inserting the hook around the post of the stitch in the row below from front to back. Creates a raised ridge that mimics knitting cables."
    },
    {
      "slug": "bptr-cushion",
      "term": "Back post treble",
      "definition": "A treble worked around the post from back to front. Used on wrong-side rows to maintain the cable texture consistently."
    }
